<p>Say you want to delete files in <code>/var/lib/files</code> created before <code>2022-01-01</code>:</p>
<div class="highlight"><pre><span></span><code>$ touch --date &quot;2022-01-01&quot; /tmp/from
$ find /var/lib/files -type f -not -newer /tmp/from -delete
</code></pre></div>

<h2>Delete friles between a from and to date</h2>
<p>Say you want to delete files only created created in <code>2020</code>:</p>
<div class="highlight"><pre><span></span><code>$ touch --date &quot;2020-01-01&quot; /tmp/from
$ touch --date &quot;2021-01-01&quot; /tmp/to
$ find /var/lib/files -type f -newer /tmp/from -not -newer /tmp/to -delete
</code></pre></div>